<view class="page {{td ? 'td' : ''}}">
  <view class="head">
    <view class="h-t">我的攻略</view>
    <view class="h-s dim">本地收藏的行程，离线可看、随时再打开</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{!empty}}">
    <view class="card mg-item" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openPlan">
      <view class="mg-top">
        <view class="mg-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="mg-del" catchtap="delPlan" data-id="{{item.id}}">删除</view>
      </view>
      <view class="mg-meta dim">{{item.cityName}} · {{item.days}} 天 · 保存于 {{item.dateText}}</view>
      <view class="mg-go">打开行程 ›</view>
    </view>
    <view class="tip">点卡片打开完整行程；删除仅移除收藏，不影响原生成记录</view>
  </block>

  <view class="empty" wx:else>
    <view class="em-ic"><image class="em-img" src="/images/icons/luggage.png"/></view>
    <block wx:if="{{loadErr}}">
      <view class="em-t">读取存档失败</view>
      <view class="em-s">本机存储暂时读不出来，已收藏的攻略不会丢失。<br/>先点下面重试，还不行就退出小程序后再进一次</view>
      <button class="em-btn btn-primary" bindtap="reload">重新读取</button>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="em-t">还没有收藏的攻略</view>
      <view class="em-s">去「出发」生成一个行程，再点「保存到我的攻略」<br/>收藏后离线可看、随时再打开</view>
      <button class="em-btn btn-primary" bindtap="goGen">去生成攻略</button>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>
